=2 Walkthrough
__You must zone after completing {q:The Titus Touch|The Titus Touch|The Titus Touch} before you can start this quest.__
* Speak to {p:Chumimi (A)} at (G-7) (east of Conflux 7 at the **Revelation Rock** oasis) to start the quest.
* You must talk to all 3 of the following NPCs for this quest:
** {p:Biggorf (A)} is behind {p:Chumimi (A)} on the left hand side at (G-7).
** {p:Chemioue (A)} is just South of {p:Chumimi (A)}, take first left. (G-7).
** {p:Tapoh Lihzeh (A)} is on the top side of the rock at the (G-6)/(G-7) border.
* Each NPC will give you two facts about a fiend (described below). You must then report them to {p:Chumimi (A)}.
* Answer them both correctly and {p:Chumimi (A)} will respond "The information you've provided corroborates with my own research perfectly! I appreciate your efforts. I must get working on my report, but please take this as a token of my thanks!". You will be rewarded 250 (500 {p:Cruor} first time) and a possible job seal.
* Answer incorrectly and {p:Chumimi (A)} will respond "The information you've provided seems reasonable enough. I appreciate your efforts. I must get working on my report, but please take this as a token of my thanks!". 200 Cruor is rewarded and **NO Seal**.

=3 Fiend Descriptions
* All 3 NPCs will describe a symptom of being attacked (headaches, chest pain, ringing ears, or dizziness) and a single descriptor from a category below. Two will give the same piece of information (correct answer) while the third will say something different (wrong answer). After speaking to all three you should have a matching symptom and a matching shape/color/habitat to report to {p:Chumimi (A)}.
* **Shape**
** Pointy, jagged horns.
*** {p:Biggorf (A)}: Fortunately, we were able to avoid bein' impaled by its sharp horns. Otherwise we'd be lookin' at serious casualties.
*** {p:Tapoh Lihzeh (A)}: He fought back as best he could, but was disarrrmed by a swipe of the fiend's jagged horns.
*** {p:Chemioue (A)}: The fiend that attacked us was a pointy-looking thing.
** Squat, rotund body.
*** {p:Biggorf (A)}: Fortunately, we were able to avoid bein' rammed full-force by its squat body. Otherwise we'd be lookin' at serious casualties.
*** {p:Tapoh Lihzeh (A)}: He fought back as best he could, but his blade bounced harrrmlessly off the fiend's round shell.
*** {p:Chemioue (A)}: The fiend that attacked us was a rather rotund critter.
** Angular, bony legs.
*** {p:Biggorf (A)}: Fortunately, we were able to avoid the vicious kick of its bony legs. Otherwise we'd be lookin' at serious casualties.
*** {p:Tapoh Lihzeh (A)}: He fought back as best he could, but the fiend danced clear out of rrrange on its four bony legs.
*** {p:Chemioue (A)}: The fiend that attacked us had an angular-looking body.
** Flat, sturdy jaw.
*** {p:Biggorf (A)}: Fortunately, we were able to avoid the crushing force of its flat jaw. Otherwise we'd be lookin' at serious casualties.
*** {p:Tapoh Lihzeh (A)}: He fought back as best he could, but his blade shattered in pieces against the fiend's flat, sturrrdy jaw.
*** {p:Chemioue (A)}: The fiend that attacked us was a curious flat creature.
* **Color**
** Extravagant.
*** {p:Biggorf (A)}: Before we knew it, it was upon us, movin' so fast we barely caught a glimpse. All I can tell you is that I remember it being an extravagantly colored beast.
*** {p:Tapoh Lihzeh (A)}: The beast was so extravagantly colored, he says he'll never forget the sight of it.
*** {p:Chemioue (A)}: The fiend that attacked us was colored most extravagantly.
** Nondescript.
*** {p:Biggorf (A)}: Before we knew it, it was upon us, movin' so fast we barely caught a glimpse. All I can tell you is that I remember it being a rather nondescript hue.
*** {p:Tapoh Lihzeh (A)}: The beast was so unremarkable in appearance, he almost didn't see it coming.
*** {p:Chemioue (A)}: The fiend that attacked us was rather subdued in hue.
** Garish.
*** {p:Biggorf (A)}: Before we knew it, it was upon us, movin' so fast we barely caught a glimpse. All I can tell you is that I remember it being a garishly colored thing.
*** {p:Tapoh Lihzeh (A)}: So garishly colored was the fiend that it sent shivers up his spine.
*** {p:Chemioue (A)}: The fiend that attacked us was of a dreadfully garish hue.
** Black and glistening.
*** {p:Biggorf (A)}: Before we knew it, it was upon us, movin' so fast we barely caught a glimpse. All I can tell you is that I remember it glistening black like obsidian.
*** {p:Tapoh Lihzeh (A)}: He was so hypnotized by its obsidian black luster that he got too close for comfort.
*** {p:Chemioue (A)}: The fiend that attacked us was glistening black.
* **Habitat**
** High elevations.
*** {p:Biggorf (A)}: The lookout who caught first sight of it said it came from high above.
*** {p:Tapoh Lihzeh (A)}: It would seem that the fiend swooped down from the sky to attack him.
*** {p:Chemioue (A)}: The fiend that attacked us descended from upon high.
** Near water.
*** {p:Biggorf (A)}: The lookout who caught first sight of it said it came from the oasis.
*** {p:Tapoh Lihzeh (A)}: It would seem that the fiend ambushed him when he was resting his legs at an oasis.
*** {p:Chemioue (A)}: The fiend that attacked us came from the water.
** Shadowy crags.
*** {p:Biggorf (A)}: The lookout who caught first sight of it said it came from a shadowy crag.
*** {p:Tapoh Lihzeh (A)}: It would seem that the fiend jumped out from behind a shadowy rock when he was on patrol.
*** {p:Chemioue (A)}: The fiend that attacked us popped out from a shadowy crag.
** Beneath the sands.
*** {p:Biggorf (A)}: The lookout who caught first sight of it said it came from below.
*** {p:Tapoh Lihzeh (A)}: It would seem that the fiend burst forth from an odd hollow in the ground.
*** {p:Chemioue (A)}: The fiend that attacked us burst forth from the sand.

__Zoning **is** required in order to repeat this quest.__
